flowchart TD
    READ["read"] --> MEM{mem fresh?}
    MEM -->|yes| SERVE["serve"]
    MEM -->|no| DB{db fresh?}
    DB -->|yes| WARM["serve + warm mem"]
    DB -->|stale| NET{network ok?}
    NET -->|yes 200/304| UPD["update caches, serve fresh"]
    NET -->|fail| CACHE{cache present?}
    CACHE -->|yes| STALE["serve stale + marker"]
    CACHE -->|no| ERR["error + retry"]
